# Per-directory attributes owned by M108. The root .gitattributes is bound by M105 and M106, and
# metamorphosis/, scripts/ and tests/ each carry an attribute file bound by M107, so no earlier
# frozen protocol can be edited to pin M108. This file is new, M108 binds it, and nothing else
# depends on its bytes. Sources outside this directory are bound by LF-normalized content instead;
# see scripts/build_m108_protocol.py.
*.md text eol=lf
*.json -text
